    <item>
      <title>Ozon realFBS 11月19日起错误率超 2% 就罚；WB 把 FBS 延迟罚款封顶 1%</title>
      <link>https://ys.tongzhoukuajing.com/news/2026-10-07-ozon-realfbs-wb-fbs-penalties</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">2026-10-07-ozon-realfbs-wb-fbs-penalties</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 12:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>两家俄罗斯平台对卖家自发货的罚则反向调整：Ozon 收紧，罚款门槛从 5% 降到 2%；Wildberries 放松，FBS 延迟发货最多罚 1%。</description>
    </item>
    <item>
